OpenNeedle (2026)

This project implements the public Needle 2 architecture and CACT format.
Architecture, quantization and archive conventions are derived from:
  Cactus Compute, Inc., cactus-compute/needle
  Commit 53df049c4a1a82fca1027b81f9ff21336dfb0861
  https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle
  Apache License, Version 2.0

needle2/tokenizer.py adapts the reference tokenizer in needle/model/export.py.
Official model weights and benchmark engine binaries retain their upstream
licenses; downloaded artifacts are not part of the Python source distribution.
